WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 b8c6113399959b0244ec1b133a63a133

00:00:01.028 --> 00:00:03.228
Kwa hiyo sasa tunaingia kwenye mazoezi ambapo

00:00:03.228 --> 00:00:05.908
watu wanaweza kufadhaika kidogo wakati mwingine.

00:00:06.628 --> 00:00:10.348
Zoezi hili, lile linalofuata, ni mazoezi ya kwanza ambayo watu hufadhaika kidogo

00:00:10.348 --> 00:00:12.067
na hawawezi kuyatatua vizuri.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.307
Kwa hiyo kama unafadhaika, usijali.

00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:15.987
Watu wengine nao wanafadhaika.

00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:18.628
Lakini hiyo pia ni fursa kubwa ya kujifunza.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:20.388
Kwa hiyo umefanya vyema kutazama video hii.

00:00:20.388 --> 00:00:23.748
Hebu tulifanye pamoja. Kama umeshalitatua, kama uliliona rahisi, sawa.

00:00:24.237 --> 00:00:27.678
Hongera. Labda bado utajifunza kitu tukiliangalia pamoja.

00:00:28.557 --> 00:00:30.038
Kwa hiyo tunajaribu kufanya nini hapa?

00:00:30.038 --> 00:00:33.838
Tunajenga roboti hii inayoweza kucheza Dungeons and Dragons.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:37.277
Dungeons and Dragons, kama hujawahi kuicheza, unapata kete nyingi.

00:00:37.277 --> 00:00:39.037
Unatupa kete kwa mambo mbalimbali.

00:00:39.628 --> 00:00:42.637
Zinakujulisha kama mambo yatafanyika au la,

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:46.078
kiasi cha nguvu ulizonazo za kugonga vitu, na mambo ya kila aina.

00:00:46.557 --> 00:00:51.518
Katika mfano huu, tunatupa kete tatu tofauti.

00:00:52.497 --> 00:00:55.938
Kwa hiyo tuna kitendakazi cha roll ambapo tunatupa kete

00:00:55.938 --> 00:00:58.658
na tunachagua idadi ya pande za kete.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:00:59.618
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema

00:01:00.578 --> 00:01:03.218
nimekosea kunakili na kubandika. Tunaweza kusema roll

00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:04.977
20

00:01:06.018 --> 00:01:11.218
kupata kete yenye pande 20. Na hiyo itatupa alama ya shambulio.

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.337
Hebu tusimame kidogo na kuhakikisha tunaelewa kinachotokea hapa.

00:01:14.418 --> 00:01:16.737
Kwa hiyo tuna kitendakazi cha roll,

00:01:17.628 --> 00:01:21.308
kitendakazi hicho cha roll kinaitwa kikiwa na 20 kama ingizo,

00:01:21.308 --> 00:01:23.867
ambayo ni idadi ya pande za kete.

00:01:24.108 --> 00:01:25.947
Na kisha kitendakazi hicho kinarejesha

00:01:26.748 --> 00:01:30.628
namba kati ya 1 na 20, ambayo itakuwa alama yetu ya shambulio.

00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:32.748
Kwa hiyo hebu tuuendeshe tu kisha tukague.

00:01:33.307 --> 00:01:35.548
Tumeunda sanduku jipya linaitwa attack.

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:38.867
Tumetupa kete na imeturudishia 1.

00:01:38.867 --> 00:01:42.908
Tukiendesha msimbo huu tena na kukagua tena, wakati huu inarejesha 16.

00:01:43.668 --> 00:01:46.468
Tukiendesha msimbo tena, wakati huu inarejesha 4.

00:01:46.548 --> 00:01:49.707
Kwa hiyo kama kete halisi, kila mara tunapoitupa,

00:01:49.707 --> 00:01:51.347
tunapata namba tofauti.

00:01:51.507 --> 00:01:54.308
Na kila wakati tunahifadhi namba hiyo, iwe ipi,

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:57.028
tunaihifadhi kwenye sanduku hili la attack.

00:01:57.347 --> 00:01:58.947
Kwa hiyo hebu tufanye vivyo hivyo kwa mengine.

00:01:59.028 --> 00:02:00.867
Tutaunda sanduku la base damage

00:02:01.427 --> 00:02:04.628
na hii itakuwa kwa kutupa kete yenye pande 12.

00:02:04.787 --> 00:02:06.787
Na kisha tuna bonus damage

00:02:07.987 --> 00:02:08.707
ambayo ni

00:02:09.508 --> 00:02:11.427
kutupa kete yenye pande kumi.

00:02:12.457 --> 00:02:14.138
Tunaweza kuuendesha na kukagua.

00:02:14.138 --> 00:02:17.018
Wakati huu tunapata 8, tunapata...

00:02:17.578 --> 00:02:21.497
Samahani, tunapata 12, tunapata 7 na tunapata 8.

00:02:22.298 --> 00:02:25.177
Hizi tena, zote tatu, zitakuwa tofauti kila mara.

00:02:26.298 --> 00:02:29.497
Sawa, kwa hiyo kisha tunapaswa kupata total damage yetu.

00:02:29.497 --> 00:02:34.298
Tunasema damage na damage yetu ni base damage

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:40.948
pamoja na bonus damage. Kwa hiyo. Sasa tuna total damage yetu.

00:02:40.948 --> 00:02:43.068
Hebu tuiite. Hebu tuiite total damage.

00:02:43.467 --> 00:02:47.788
Kwa hiyo tuna attack yetu, base damage yetu, bonus damage, na total damage yetu.

00:02:49.228 --> 00:02:50.707
Na kisha tuna agizo hili.

00:02:50.707 --> 00:02:56.068
Kila baada ya kutupa kete, unahitaji kutangaza namba uliyotupa kwa

00:02:56.068 --> 00:02:57.627
watu wengine unaocheza nao.

00:02:57.867 --> 00:03:01.147
Sawa? Kwa hiyo hebu tutangaze attack yetu,

00:03:02.268 --> 00:03:04.668
na pia hebu tutangaze

00:03:06.008 --> 00:03:09.048
base damage yetu. Na hebu tutangaze bonus damage yetu.

00:03:11.768 --> 00:03:15.168
Na kisha inasema ukijaribu kugonga bila kutangaza namba,

00:03:15.168 --> 00:03:16.247
wanaweza kudhani unadanganya.

00:03:16.568 --> 00:03:18.807
Nina hakika hutawahi kudanganya, lakini ni sawa.

00:03:19.927 --> 00:03:22.888
Sawa. Na kisha jambo la mwisho ni kumgonga Goblin

00:03:23.207 --> 00:03:25.407
kwa attack yako na total damage.

00:03:25.407 --> 00:03:26.168
Kwa hiyo strike

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:28.568
kwa attack yako

00:03:30.008 --> 00:03:31.927
na total damage yako.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.728
Na tunaweza kuendesha msimbo. Na tazama.

00:03:36.728 --> 00:03:39.848
Inafanya kazi. Tunapata 3 na 11 na 3.

00:03:40.647 --> 00:03:42.048
Hizo ni namba zetu wakati huu.

00:03:42.048 --> 00:03:46.967
Kwa hiyo tukibofya hapa na kupitia, tunapata 3, tunapata 11

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:51.288
na tunapata 3. Na tukiuendesha tena,

00:03:52.328 --> 00:03:54.247
tutapata 3, 5, na 2.

00:03:54.247 --> 00:03:58.008
Na tunaweza kupitia hatua kwa hatua na kuona roll 20 ilirejesha 3.

00:03:58.377 --> 00:03:59.818
Tunaihifadhi kwenye sanduku la attack.

00:03:59.978 --> 00:04:02.777
Tunachukua sanduku la attack, tunatoa 3 iliyomo, na tunaitangaza.

00:04:03.018 --> 00:04:06.217
roll 12 ilirejesha 5. Vivyo hivyo tena.

00:04:07.337 --> 00:04:09.258
roll 10, wakati huu ilirejesha 2.

00:04:09.337 --> 00:04:12.978
Kwa hiyo tunatangaza hiyo 2, tunazijumlisha,

00:04:12.978 --> 00:04:16.377
tunachukua base damage na kupata 5, bonus damage na kupata 2.

00:04:16.377 --> 00:04:19.577
Tunazijumlisha, tunapata 7, tuna total damage yetu.

00:04:19.737 --> 00:04:24.338
Na kisha mwisho tunagonga kwa kuchukua attack yenye 3 na total

00:04:24.338 --> 00:04:27.218
damage yenye 7. Kisha kitendakazi chetu cha strike.

00:04:28.338 --> 00:04:30.817
Kwa hiyo natumaini sasa umeona jinsi tulivyolitatua.

00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:36.098
Si ngumu sana. Kama kawaida, ushauri wangu mkubwa ni kuhakikisha unagawanya

00:04:36.098 --> 00:04:38.017
mambo katika hatua hizi tofauti.

00:04:38.418 --> 00:04:41.858
Na hasa sasa tunapokutana na vitendakazi vinavyorejesha vitu.

00:04:42.017 --> 00:04:44.377
Ni muhimu kuanza na upande wa kulia

00:04:44.377 --> 00:04:47.028
wa alama ya sawa na kuufikiria kama

00:04:47.908 --> 00:04:50.817
kitu kimoja akilini mwako. Hiki tunakiita usemi.

00:04:51.387 --> 00:04:54.348
Ni kitu kinachotokea upande wa kulia wa alama ya sawa.

00:04:55.148 --> 00:05:00.108
Na ni muhimu kuchakata usemi huo akilini mwako kwanza.

00:05:00.348 --> 00:05:03.627
Huu pia ni usemi, hiki jumlisha hiki.

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:06.267
Kwa hiyo sehemu hii hapa, hii ndiyo inaendeshwa.

00:05:06.267 --> 00:05:10.348
Jiki anauendesha kwa kujumlisha hizo mbili. Thamani za masanduku mawili.

00:05:10.827 --> 00:05:14.427
Na kisha akishamaliza hilo, anaenda kuiweka kwenye sanduku hili.

00:05:14.827 --> 00:05:17.307
Kwa hiyo hakikisha unafikiria hii kama hatua moja na

00:05:17.307 --> 00:05:19.708
kisha kuweka thamani kwenye sanduku kama hatua inayofuata.

00:05:20.408 --> 00:05:24.168
Hii ni hatua inayofuata. Igawanye hivyo na natumaini, mambo

00:05:24.487 --> 00:05:29.367
yatakuwa rahisi kabisa. Bahati njema. Zoezi linalofuata utakalofanya ni lingine

00:05:29.367 --> 00:05:31.127
ambalo watu wanaweza kufadhaika sana nalo.

00:05:31.447 --> 00:05:33.687
Jaribu tu kutumia kile ulichojifunza hapa.

00:05:33.687 --> 00:05:35.608
Punguza mwendo kidogo. Na,

00:05:36.408 --> 00:05:38.887
usiogope kutazama video kama unaihitaji.

00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:41.687
Lakini jaribu, jaribu kulitatua mwenyewe.

00:05:41.687 --> 00:05:44.807
Na usisahau, unaweza kutumia kichupo hiki cha Uliza Jiki pia.

00:05:45.048 --> 00:05:48.247
Ni njia muhimu sana ya kuchunguza na kubadilishana mawazo.

00:05:48.408 --> 00:05:51.208
Kwa hiyo hakikisha unakijaribu. Asante kwa kutazama.
